From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luisyr <106528106+luisyr1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/21] arm64: dts: exynos: google: zumapro-komodo: Add the AoC
 sound card

The AoC's ASoC card as stock's zumapro DTB describes it, from
zumapro-tegu's card node (derekross/linux-omamobile#193, still open,
which documents the google-aoc-* bindings), with komodo's codecs: both
CS35L41 on TDM 0 (stock dtbo fragments 52 and 53), BCLK as their system
clock (fragment 54) and the Top/Bottom prefixes. Card name
"google,komodo-aoc-snd-card", so no other phone's UCM profile or
WirePlumber rule matches it. Haptics, DisplayPort and the HAC enable
are left out.

aoc_alsa_dev is blacklisted on komodo; the card only comes up when the
bring-up loads it after the AoC is online.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
